{"id":"memorial_201202","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial201200","label":"UNBREAKABLE SPHERE · Her Forgotten Story"},"label":"Entry 2","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_201201","next":"memorial_201203","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_201202_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"I think I've found something I can do."},{"id":"memorial_201202_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"I sent out a few bubbles into the expanse, and while investigating Gluttony's insides, I discovered what seems to be a sort of breathing hole that opens once a week."},{"id":"memorial_201202_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"Perhaps I can send out bubbles from there and let everyone know that I'm here."},{"id":"memorial_201202_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"There might still be a way for me to help."},{"id":"memorial_201202_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"Right. The bubbles should work."},{"id":"memorial_201202_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"Abe is the one who gave them to me, after all."},{"id":"memorial_201202_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_02_description","text":"I should try sending one up as a test today."}]}